  "Posted 9 December 2001, before Theed Palace, so the format is Premiere - Reflections III.",
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (8): Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed, Endor, Endor: Rebel Landing Site (Forest), Heading For The Medical Frigate, Strike Planning, Squadron Assignments, The Shield Is Down!, An Unusual Amount Of Fear; these count toward the 60.",
  "The trailing 'tata' is a sign-off, not a card. The '3-0' in the title is a record with no named event.",
  "Posted 'General Crixy Madine' dested General Crix Madine; 'Lieutenent Greave' Lieutenant Greeve; 'Lieutenent Blunt' Lieutenant Blount; 'Colonel Crackhead' Colonel Cracken; 'Wedge Antilles, Rogue Squadron Leader' Wedge Antilles, Red Squadron Leader; 'Obi Wan w/ Saber' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'Honor of the Jai' Honor Of The Jedi; 'Rebel Landing Site', 'Back Door', 'Bunker', 'Hidden Forest Trail' the Endor sites.",
  "Posted 'Out of Commission x3' kept as the single Interrupt Out Of Commission, separate from the 'Out of Commission/ Transmission Term.' combo; 'Bith Shuffle/ Desperate Reach', 'All Wings Report In/ Darklighter Spin' and 'Battle Plan/ Draw Their Fire' dested the combo cards.",
